{"seq":3,"slug":"concurrent-service-checklist","title":"并发服务设计清单","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/practice/concurrent-service-checklist","wordCount":612,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"并发服务设计清单\">并发服务设计清单</h1><p>将前面所有模式与技巧落地到一个真实的 Go 后端服务中，需要一份系统性的设计清单——从容器适配的 GOMAXPROCS 设置，到请求级 context 传播，到 Worker Pool 的池大小调优，再到优雅关停的信号处理。本文按服务的生命周期阶段（启动→运行→关停）组织一套可直接对照执行的并发工程实践。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;启动阶段&quot;&#10;        S1[&quot;设置 GOMAXPROCS&quot;]&#10;        S2[&quot;初始化 Worker Pool&quot;]&#10;        S3[&quot;注册信号处理&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;运行阶段&quot;&#10;        R1[&quot;请求级 context 传播&quot;]&#10;        R2[&quot;errgroup 协调子任务&quot;]&#10;        R3[&quot;goroutine 生命周期管理&quot;]&#10;        R4[&quot;监控 go_goroutines&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;关停阶段&quot;&#10;        D1[&quot;停止接受新请求&quot;]&#10;        D2[&quot;等待进行中请求完成&quot;]&#10;        D3[&quot;关停 Worker Pool&quot;]&#10;        D4[&quot;释放资源&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    S1 --&gt; S2 --&gt; S3 --&gt; R1&#10;    R1 --&gt; R2 --&gt; R3 --&gt; R4&#10;    R4 --&gt; D1 --&gt; D2 --&gt; D3 --&gt; D4\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"启动阶段\"\n        S1[\"设置 GOMAXPROCS\"]\n        S2[\"初始化 Worker Pool\"]\n        S3[\"注册信号处理\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"运行阶段\"\n        R1[\"请求级 context 传播\"]\n        R2[\"errgroup 协调子任务\"]\n        R3[\"goroutine 生命周期管理\"]\n        R4[\"监控 go_goroutines\"]\n    end\n    subgraph \"关停阶段\"\n        D1[\"停止接受新请求\"]\n        D2[\"等待进行中请求完成\"]\n        D3[\"关停 Worker Pool\"]\n        D4[\"释放资源\"]\n    end\n    S1 --&gt; S2 --&gt; S3 --&gt; R1\n    R1 --&gt; R2 --&gt; R3 --&gt; R4\n    R4 --&gt; D1 --&gt; D2 --&gt; D3 --&gt; D4</pre><h2 id=\"启动阶段清单\">启动阶段清单</h2><h3 id=\"1-gomaxprocs-容器适配\">1. GOMAXPROCS 容器适配</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>部署环境</th>\n<th>推荐设置</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>裸金属/VM</td>\n<td>默认（NumCPU）</td>\n<td>无需额外设置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>K8s（有 CPU limit）</td>\n<td>等于 CPU limit</td>\n<td><code>uber-go/automaxprocs</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>K8s（无 limit）</td>\n<td>手动设为预期核心数</td>\n<td>环境变量注入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lambda/Serverless</td>\n<td>通常 1-2</td>\n<td>平台约束</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"import _ &quot;go.uber.org/automaxprocs&quot;&#10;&#10;func main() {&#10;    // automaxprocs 自动读取 cgroup 的 cpu.cfs_quota_us&#10;    // 并设置 GOMAXPROCS = quota / period&#10;    // 日志输出: maxprocs: Updating GOMAXPROCS=4: determined from CPU quota&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">go.uber.org/automaxprocs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // automaxprocs 自动读取 cgroup 的 cpu.cfs_quota_us</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 并设置 GOMAXPROCS = quota / period</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 日志输出: maxprocs: Updating GOMAXPROCS=4: determined from CPU quota</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"2-worker-pool-初始化\">2. Worker Pool 初始化</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"type Server struct {&#10;    httpPool   *errgroup.Group // HTTP 请求处理并发&#10;    bgPool     *ants.Pool     // 后台任务处理&#10;    dbPool     *sql.DB        // 数据库连接池&#10;}&#10;&#10;func NewServer(cfg Config) *Server {&#10;    bgPool, _ := ants.NewPool(cfg.BgWorkers,&#10;        ants.WithPreAlloc(true),&#10;        ants.WithExpiryDuration(30*time.Second),&#10;    )&#10;    return &amp;Server{&#10;        bgPool: bgPool,&#10;        dbPool: initDB(cfg.DBMaxConns),&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Server</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    httpPool   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">errgroup</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Group</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // HTTP 请求处理并发</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bgPool     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ants</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Pool</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     // 后台任务处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dbPool     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\